    would you expect if the required setup is correct? Distinguish a predicted result
    from a measured result."
  practice: "In Level 26, perform the objective \u2018220 Ohm Resistor Voltage\u2019
    in the actual game laboratory. Compare fresh evidence against: Verify a drop
    of 1.3 to 1.9 V across the 220 ohm resistor. voltage \u2265 1.3 V. voltage \u2264
    1.9 V. Connection pair R_LIMIT_Input and R_LIMIT_Output.\nThe mission evaluator
